        <gr str="3966">greatly </gr>shall he <gr str="1523">rejoice</gr>! </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="2"> Thou hast <gr str="5414">given </gr>him his <gr str="3820">heart </gr>'s <gr str="8378">desire</gr>, and hast <gr str="1077">not </gr>
