      <VERS vnumber="13"> Be thou <gr str="7311">exalted</gr>, <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, in thine own <gr str="5797">strength</gr>: <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> so </STYLE> will we <gr str="7891">sing </gr>and <gr str="2167">praise </gr>thy <gr str="1369">power</gr>. </VERS>
